ex:C069R0008Condition345 a ct:Condition ;
    ct:description "3.10.2 Each Party will promptly notify the JDC, in writing, of any worker claims of suspected occupational illnesses related to working with the Product, regardless of whether such claims are received during the Development Term or any time thereafter. After termination of this Agreement for whatever reasons, or expiration of this Agreement, each Party will promptly notify the other Party of any worker claims of suspected occupational illnesses related to working with the Product during the Development Term, of which it has knowledge." ;
