    ct:description "5.1.2 Chairperson. The JSC chairperson (\"JSC Chairperson\") shall be designated from the Parties' JSC Representatives and shall serve for a term of one (1) year. SFJ shall appoint the first JSC Chairperson and subsequent appointments will rotate on an annual basis between PB and SFJ. The JSC Chairperson will be responsible for drafting and circulating the draft agenda and ensuring minutes are prepared." ;
    ct:supported_by ex:C069P0431 ;
    meta:review_status "UNREVIEWED" .

